{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh PC conversion of an iPhone classic. Collect seeds and plant blocks to stay ahead of the rising flood waters. Planting different seeds will produce different structures! Be careful! The pirate octopuses are aiming to take you for a swim. As you ascend, you'll find structures left by some unseen architect that you'll have to puzzle your way through. The waters rise slowly at first but the longer you live, the harder it is to stay alive! A simple yet engaging arcade action game in the spirit of the time wasters of the 1980s!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964610?t=1758215245","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964610?t=1758215245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964610/34c51758e812de73450ca3d727d3db5353f3b855/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758215245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964610/34c51758e812de73450ca3d727d3db5353f3b855/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758215245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh PC conversion of an iPhone classic. Collect seeds and plant blocks to stay ahead of the rising flood waters. Planting different seeds will produce different structures! Be careful! The pirate octopuses are aiming to take you for a swim. As you ascend, you'll find structures left by some unseen architect that you'll have to puzzle your way through. The waters rise slowly at first but the longer you live, the harder it is to stay alive! A simple yet engaging arcade action game in the spirit of the time wasters of the 1980s!\u00a0</p>","developers":["Donn Ha"],"genres":[{"descrip